    },
    {
      "file": "page-10.mp3",
      "text": "Back in the kitchen, Alex asks if he can help. Elena gives him a stack of plates and thanks him. He notices a dish he has never tried before and asks about its ingredients. Then he carries the plates towards the dining room.",
      "kind": "narration",
