      "textSha256": "14c81f6983a853d7b60d1ebbc5b9ccac334f66a06a55737198ec6bf7326c1d8b",
      "sha256": "4be305d317258bf15b97a03fb88082869a4ce3dff1b9b2f08621d05567500475",
      "bytes": 49363
    },
    {
      "file": "page-16.mp3",
      "text": "At the door, Alex thanks everyone for dinner and for making him feel welcome. He mentions the garden, the photographs and Rosa's story. 'Come again,' Elena says. Walking outside with Maya, Alex realises that making a good impression did not require being perfect.",
