      "text": "Which objects connect the beginning and the end of the story?",
      "kind": "question",
      "textSha256": "f79ed70247e61266818e4994a247e20e52e7057b095dcc2a1ebb547d4660bbf3",
      "sha256": "7c322a514538b710c681a45821ac19c7838e3cd54f31228992c9bdc7b29b9f71",
      "bytes": 53960
    },
    {
      "file": "page-17-q3.mp3",
      "text": "How might he feel as he remembers the evening? Explain.",
      "kind": "question",
      "textSha256": "54a499589d255ad164d8cd7d1c3a52ef1887facc931e232e9bcb3d6cfc694387",
      "sha256": "51024b3a21a13fc37dc33d11f8561c967371cd1b0ecfcd52aa5266e4c4c5bc30",
      "bytes": 55214
    },
    {
